---
const phone = "1660-4350";
const tel = "16604350";

const areas = [
  "강남구", "신사동", "논현1동", "논현2동", "압구정동", "청담동",
  "삼성1동", "삼성2동", "대치1동", "대치2동", "대치4동",
  "역삼1동", "역삼2동", "도곡1동", "도곡2동",
  "개포1동", "개포2동", "개포3동", "개포4동",
  "일원본동", "일원1동", "수서동", "세곡동"
];

const services = [
  "누수탐지", "하수구막힘", "싱크대막힘", "변기막힘",
  "배수구막힘", "배관공사", "욕실누수", "천장누수"
];

const title = "강남구 누수탐지 배관설비 전문 | 배관솔루션";
const description = "강남구 누수탐지, 배관설비, 하수구막힘 전문. 친절 상담 1660-4350. 정확한 진단, 필요한 공사, 1년 A/S 보장.";
---

<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
	<meta name="google-site-verification" content="Yrur1bsOtzMgUxDuBjVa0HLE0cGxcayg0L6TC3Cc59U" />
    <meta name="naver-site-verification" content="804c9e81ace7ca9b897525c2196c9c983716c26f" />
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://gangnam-leak.netlify.app/" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="top-bar">강남구 누수탐지 · 배관설비 24시간 친절 상담</div>

    <header class="header">
      <div class="header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="logo">배관솔루션</a>
        <a class="phone-btn" href={`tel:${tel}`}>대표전화 {phone}</a>
        <nav>
          <a href="#service">주요서비스</a>
          <a href="#works">공사실적</a>
          <a href="#area">강남구 지역</a>
          <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-photo">
          <div>
            <strong>현장 이미지</strong>
            <span>사진 준비 후 교체</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p>365일 친절 상담</p>
          <h1>강남구 누수탐지<br />배관설비 전문</h1>
          <a href={`tel:${tel}`} class="hero-call">☎ {phone}</a>
          <span>정확한 진단 · 필요한 공사 · 1년 A/S 보장</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="as-section">
        <h2>배관솔루션은 <strong>1년 A/S</strong>로 안심을 보장합니다.</h2>
        <p>강남구 아파트, 빌라, 상가, 사무실 현장 상황에 맞춰 필요한 작업만 안내합니다.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="service" class="service-cards">
        <article>
          <div class="thumb">01</div>
          <h3>누수탐지</h3>
          <p>수도, 온수, 난방배관 누수 원인을 장비와 현장 확인을 통해 안내합니다.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="thumb">02</div>
          <h3>배관설비</h3>
          <p>노후 배관, 부분 보수, 배관 교체 등 필요한 범위의 작업을 진행합니다.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="thumb">03</div>
          <h3>하수구 막힘</h3>
          <p>싱크대, 욕실, 베란다, 변기 막힘과 역류 증상을 현장 기준으로 확인합니다.</p>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section id="works" class="works">
        <h2>강남구 공사실적</h2>
        <p>강남구 주요 지역별 누수탐지와 배관설비 상담이 가능합니다.</p>

        <div class="work-cards">
          {areas.slice(1, 9).map((area) => (
            <a href={`/${area}-누수탐지`}>
              <div>{area}</div>
              <h3>{area} 누수탐지 현장</h3>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="area" class="area-section">
        <h2>강남구 지역별 바로가기</h2>
        <div class="area-links">
          {areas.map((area) => (
            <a href={`/${area}-누수탐지`}>{area} 누수탐지</a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="service-links">
        <h2>주요 서비스 바로가기</h2>
        <div class="area-links">
          {services.map((service) => (
            <a href={`/강남구-${service}`}>강남구 {service}</a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="faq" class="faq-section">
        <div class="faq-photo">
          <strong>상담 가능</strong>
          <span>강남구 전 지역</span>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-content">
          <h2>자주 묻는 질문</h2>

          <details>
            <summary>강남구 누수탐지 비용은 얼마인가요?</summary>
            <p>현장 구조와 증상에 따라 달라질 수 있어 전화 상담 후 안내드립니다.</p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>아파트 아래층 천장 누수도 확인 가능한가요?</summary>
            <p>가능합니다. 윗집 배관, 욕실, 난방, 수도 계통 등을 현장 기준으로 확인합니다.</p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>하수구 막힘도 당일 상담 가능한가요?</summary>
            <p>현장 일정에 따라 당일 상담과 방문 안내가 가능합니다.</p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>작업 후 A/S도 가능한가요?</summary>
            <p>작업 내용과 현장 조건에 따라 A/S 기준을 안내드립니다.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bottom-services">
        <div>
          <strong>01</strong>
          <h3>누수탐지</h3>
          <p>수도, 온수, 난방배관 누수 확인</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>02</strong>
          <h3>하수구 막힘</h3>
          <p>싱크대, 욕실, 베란다 배수 문제</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>03</strong>
          <h3>변기 막힘</h3>
          <p>변기 막힘과 역류 증상 확인</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>04</strong>
          <h3>배관공사</h3>
          <p>노후 배관 교체와 부분 보수</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cta-banner">
        <p>강남구 누수탐지 · 배관설비 상담</p>
        <h2>친절 상담 전화</h2>
        <a href={`tel:${tel}`}>☎ {phone}</a>
        <span>정확한 진단 · 필요한 공사 · 1년 A/S 보장</span>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <h2>배관솔루션</h2>
      <p>강남구 누수탐지 · 배관설비 · 하수구막힘 전문</p>
      <a href={`tel:${tel}`}>친절 상담 {phone}</a>
      <small>© 2026 배관솔루션 All Rights Reserved.</small>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html {
    word-break: keep-all;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif;
    color: #222;
    background: #fff;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  a { text-decoration: none; }

  .top-bar {
    background: #063f9e;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .header {
    background: #fff;
  }

  .header-inner {
    max-width: 1180px;
    min-height: 110px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 22px 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .logo {
    color: #0b4eb3;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 950;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .phone-btn {
    background: #2867c9;
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 900;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 22px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  nav a {
    color: #111;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    min-height: 720px;
  }

  .hero-photo {
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.25), rgba(0,0,0,.25)),
      linear-gradient(135deg, #d8e2ef, #f4f7fb);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .hero-photo div,
  .faq-photo {
    border: 2px dashed rgba(0,0,0,.2);
    border-radius: 26px;
    padding: 34px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-photo strong,
  .faq-photo strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 34px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #073f9f;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    background: #073f9f;
    color: white;
    padding: 60px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 22px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-copy p {
    color: #ffd400;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 24px);
    font-weight: 900;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hero-copy h1 {
    font-size: clamp(44px, 5vw, 76px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
  }

  .hero-call {
    display: inline-flex;
    justify-content: center;
    max-width: 100%;
    background: white;
    color: #111;
    padding: 18px 56px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 950;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.16);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .hero-copy span {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 22px);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .as-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 80px 20px 42px;
  }

  .as-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 42px);
  }

  .as-section strong { color: #2165c8; }

  .as-section p {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .service-cards {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto 100px;
    padding: 0 20px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .service-cards article {
    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    background: white;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .thumb {
    height: 210px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d4fb3, #2e7ff0);
    color: #ffd400;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 54px;
    font-weight: 950;
  }

  .service-cards h3 {
    color: #1f63c6;
    font-size: 24px;
    margin: 28px 20px 12px;
  }

  .service-cards p {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 28px 34px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .works,
  .area-section,
  .service-links {
    background: #f7f7f7;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 85px 20px;
  }

  .service-links {
    background: #fff;
  }

  .works h2,
  .area-section h2,
  .service-links h2 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 44px);
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .work-cards {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 40px auto 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .work-cards a {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    color: #111;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .work-cards div {
    height: 180px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg,#0d4fb3,#347ef0);
    color: white;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 900;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .work-cards h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    padding: 18px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .area-links {
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 35px auto 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .area-links a {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    color: #111;
    padding: 17px 12px;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .service-links .area-links a {
    background: #f7f7f7;
  }

  .faq-section {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 90px auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.12fr;
    gap: 70px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .faq-photo {
    min-height: 420px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e4eaf3, #f8f8f8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 80px;
  }

  .faq-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  details {
    background: #2867c9;
    color: #fff;
    margin-top: 15px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 20px 28px;
  }

  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  details p {
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .bottom-services {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    background: #333;
  }

  .bottom-services div {
    min-height: 330px;
    padding: 70px 34px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.58), rgba(0,0,0,.58));
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
  }

  .bottom-services strong,
  .bottom-services h3 {
    color: #ffd400;
  }

  .bottom-services strong {
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 950;
  }

  .bottom-services h3 {
    font-size: 25px;
    margin: 26px 0 18px;
  }

  .bottom-services p {
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cta-banner {
    background: #073f9f;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 80px 20px;
  }

  .cta-banner p {
    color: #ffd400;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }

  .cta-banner h2 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 48px);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-weight: 950;
  }

  .cta-banner a {
    display: inline-flex;
    justify-content: center;
    background: white;
    color: #111;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 18px 58px;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 950;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .cta-banner span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  footer {
    background: #2867c9;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 70px 20px 36px;
  }

  footer h2 {
    font-size: 34px;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  footer a {
    color: #ffd400;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 950;
  }

  footer small {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 42px;
    opacity: .85;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .header-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .hero,
    .service-cards,
    .faq-section,
    .bottom-services {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .hero-photo {
      min-height: 300px;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      min-height: 430px;
    }

    .work-cards,
    .area-links {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .top-bar {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .header-inner {
      padding: 20px 14px;
    }

    nav {
      gap: 10px 16px;
    }

    nav a {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .phone-btn {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      padding: 45px 18px;
    }

    .hero-copy h1 {
      font-size: 38px;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .hero-call,
    .cta-banner a {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 16px 10px;
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .work-cards,
    .area-links {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .faq-photo {
      min-height: 280px;
      border-radius: 42px;
    }

    details {
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>